WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.650
Someone once said...

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:58.390
So plump and soft, you can't 
help but say "It's delicious"

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:03.230
about the first-rate rice 
that can be harvested

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:06.800
from the rice field growing 
on this horse's back...

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:11.070
Delicious Horice!

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:19.050
There are exquisite cherries that 
grow just like lily of the valley...

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:23.680
Cherries of the Valley!

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:29.120
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:34.730
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:40.900
There are two training ingredients left 
on the IGO President, Ichiryu's list.

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:46.110
One is somewhere in the Lost Forest, 
the Human World's vastest sea of trees.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.810
I know it's in there,

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:53.980
but the area is so vast that 
I can't pinpoint its location.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.820
Fortune-telling Sushi
Monchy

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.980
Toriko decided to have Monchy, the 
fortune-telling sushi crafstman,

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:00.690
divine the ingredient's exact location,

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:03.820
but first he has to gather 
fillings for a Fortune Roll.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:12.160
We got it!

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:14.730
That's the Madam Fish?! It's huge!

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.600
After the Madam Fish, they next 
set their sights on capturing

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:22.610
King Vinegar, the king of all 
vinegars, on Firewater Island.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.780
You think I can make it with the 
Madam Fish and King Vinegar alone?!

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:28.580
King Vinegar

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.580
That's not nearly enough fillings!

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.920
They continued to gather 
fillings for the Fortune Roll.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.350
Toriko and Komatsu set out 
to capture the Durian Bomb,

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:38.420
the stinkiest ingredient in the world!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.230
Uh-oh! Oh, boy!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:51.270
They collapsed a countless number 
of times from the tremendous stink,

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:54.510
but were finally able to 
obtain the Durian Bomb.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.270
However...

00:03:56.610 --> 00:04:01.550
Are we doomed to live as 
totally smelly characters?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:11.150
Too Huge! The Giant Fortune Roll, 
Completed with a Pro Wrestling Move!

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:30.870
I-I'm just grateful, right, Komatsu?!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.540
We're not stinky characters anymore!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.950
That's right, Toriko-san! Now 
I can finally go back to work!

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:41.180
Who would've figured, the 
method to dissipate the stink

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.390
of the Durian Bomb is to eat its fruit!

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:50.260
Terry, you steered clear of me too 
'til the stink went away, huh?

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:55.100
I thought I'd never get to 
touch this soft fur ever again!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.800
By the way, Toriko-san,

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:00.640
after gathering all those materials for the 
Fortune Roll, they're still not enough?

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.040
Nope!

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.210
But we just got one more to go!

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:06.010
What are you, stupid?!

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:09.940
What are we gonna do without 
seaweed?! Go get some, dumbass!

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:14.250
Monchy went on about needing 
seaweed to wrap the Fortune Roll.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.620
Seaweed?!

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.050
Another basic ingredient he doesn't have...

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:23.360
So I thought we'd go to a place I'm familiar 
with to get some delicious seaweed.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:24.530
Get some?

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:25.060
Yeah.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.060
There it is!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.070
That hill!

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:40.910
This scent brings back memories...

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:42.510
It hasn't changed a bit.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:45.110
You know this place, Toriko-san?

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:45.610
Yep.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.420
An old friend lives here.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.690
Fork Shield!

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:55.990
Knife!

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:00.360
What is this?!

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:04.800
Hey!

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.000
I'm no poacher!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.240
That's a fine way to greet me!

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:15.940
I am Akimaru of the Gourmet 
Knight Four Seasons Clan.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.840
Please forgive my rash rudeness.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:20.810
Gourmet Knight?

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.210
Then, Toriko-san...

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:22.880
Uh-huh.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.880
Toriko-san! Komatsu-san!

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:27.090
Long time no see!

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:30.020
I was right! Takimaru-san!

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.260
Yo, Takimaru!

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:34.190
What's wrong? You suddenly show up here...

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.830
What?!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.500
I'm just in the area to get an ingredient.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.330
That aside, Takimaru,

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.430
it looks like your cells have evolved 
some since the last time I saw you.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.970
You've really developed!

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:59.580
T-Thank you!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.520
But what was that attack about?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.360
An order from your leader?

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:12.700
Of course, it was my order.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.970
Maybe it was a bit too lukewarm 
of a greeting for you, though...

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.900
You wanna know why?

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:21.370
'Cause you guys are light eaters!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.170
Right, Ai?!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.940
It's been a while, Toriko.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.880
I hear you took good care of 
our Takimaru that last time.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.410
I thank you.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.850
Aw, I don't need any thanks.

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:33.850
More importantly...

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.820
...you look well.

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.730
I'm relieved you're not dead!

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:44.890
Same here!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:53.200
Don't overestimate Takimaru, Toriko.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.240
Ai...

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.670
Takimaru saved your life.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.140
Give him credit for his development.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.980
Among our ranks, he's still green.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.150
I see...

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:08.180
Sorry, I didn't introduce myself.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.790
I'm Yukimaru of the Blue Sky Clan.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:13.520
I'm Raimaru, also of the Blue Sky Clan.

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.960
Kagemaru, Hidden Leaves Clan.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:18.760
Tsukimaru, Milky Way Clan.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.960
Certainly, you all seem very impressive.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.800
A team made up of the best 
and the brightest, huh?

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.900
But you're all too skinny!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.040
Are you gettin' enough to eat?!

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:29.600
Hey, knock it off!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.440
We have precepts about humble fare.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.810
Why don't you cut back a little bit?

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:37.380
What's that?! Like I'd ever cut back!

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:40.310
That's right, I'm sure you 
live a life of debauchery!

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.120
Try fasting once.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.320
Forget it!

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.250
I ain't interested in any 
Gourmet Knight teachings!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.690
So that's Gourmet Hunter Toriko...

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:49.620
If you don't eat more meat, 
you're gonna keel over again!

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:52.390
So it really was true that he and 
Aimaru-san are old friends...

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:50.990
Mind your own business!

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:54.060
Our humble fare is healthy for the body!

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:56.300
But this is the most I've 
ever seen Aimaru-san speak...

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.060
No matter how good it is for the body,

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:58.330
it's pointless if it makes you weak!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.230
By the way, Komatsu-san...

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:00.300
What was that?! Belittling 
Gourmet Knights like that

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.170
Exactly what ingredient are 
you looking for in this area?

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.600
will only get you hurt!

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:04.370
Get hurt?! Is that right?!

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:08.310
Seaweed, but I don't know the details...

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:11.440
Seaweed? Oh, maybe it's Eco Seaweed...

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.580
Eco Seaweed?

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.850
There's a village near here called Eco Land

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:20.790
and there's seaweed you can take from 
the shells of turtles that live there.

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:26.060
The area is called the Humble Fare Zone 
since there are only simple ingredients,

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.530
but that seaweed is outstanding.

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:30.700
If you'd like, I can take you there tomorrow.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.130
You read my mind, Takimaru!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:36.100
That's exactly why we came 
here, so I'm countin' on you!

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.540
R-Right!

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:39.270
Hey!

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:41.570
I'm not done talking to you, Toriko!

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:44.280
You should ditch that ill-mannered leader!

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:46.110
Who's got ill manners?!

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:47.550
Hey!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:56.150
This is good!

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:59.490
Humble fare ain't bad, actually.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:00.790
Right?!

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.300
So, are you ready?

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:08.870
Ready to get GOD...

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.230
Of course.

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:12.900
And I've already assembled my Full Course...

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:21.480
Modest Grass

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.480
Hors d'Oeuvre: Modest Grass.

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:24.520
Graceful Soup

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:24.520
Soup: Graceful Soup.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:27.780
Frugal Sardine

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:27.780
Fish: Frugal Sardine.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.690
Love Pork

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.690
Meat: Love Pork.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.560
Simple Rice

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:33.560
Main Dish: Simple Rice.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:36.460
Inexhaustible Potato

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.460
Salad: Inexhaustible Potato.

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:39.260
Plum Peach

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:39.260
Dessert: Plum Peach.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.700
Quiet Tea

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.330
Drink: Quiet Tea.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:46.540
Awesome.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:49.540
All simple, yet every last one 
is a wonderful ingredient.

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:55.410
But it seems the competition for GOD isn’t 
just between the two of us, Toriko.

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:56.650
Yeah, well...

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:58.680
But no worries there.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:00.380
Even if it comes to war,

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:02.620
I'm gonna get GOD.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.690
Relax, Toriko.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:08.520
Even if I get GOD first,

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:12.260
I'll be a nice guy and share it 
with you for old times' sake.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:15.800
Don't talk nonsense, Ai.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.870
I'm gonna get it first.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.300
No, I will.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:20.500
And then I'll share it, like I said.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.970
I'm gonna share it with <i>you</i>!

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:24.640
You don't get it!

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:26.510
Who do you think <i>you</i> are?!

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:27.510
Who are <i>you</i>?!

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:28.880
What?!

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:30.880
There they go again...

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:31.750
There's no way a blockhead 
like you could ever get it!

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:34.920
Toriko-san isn't usually so 
quick to get into a fight...

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.120
You know, muscles aren't everything!

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.480
You ought to try a little temperance!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.580
The same with Aimaru-san...

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.420
Temperance?! What the hell is that?!

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:39.920
Well, I guess they can fight like 
that because they're so close.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.390
I never ate it, so bring me some!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.760
Let's pay them no mind.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:43.860
Yeah...

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.640
It seems like an idyllic village...

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:06.780
This village doesn't have electricity, 
gas, or even running water.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:11.520
The villagers rely 100% on the 
blessings already provided by nature.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.620
So that's why it's called Eco Land, huh?

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:17.190
Living together with nature, naturally...

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:20.160
There's no village that's kinder 
to the planet and living beings.

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.400
Hey!

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:26.200
Stupid wild rabbits!

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:28.530
Always stealin' my food...!

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.440
Morons!

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.770
Gimme back my onigiri, dumbasses!

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:36.680
There's somebody who's not kind at all...

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:38.380
Idiots!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.050
What the hell are you lookin' at, jerk?!

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:42.750
Are you stupid?!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.190
N-No, I'm not stupid!

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:49.250
Huh? Monchy-san?

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.320
Mayor Nonchy!

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:53.560
It's been a long time!

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:55.930
Takimaru? What's up?!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.030
We came here to get something...

00:12:58.030 --> 00:12:59.770
What is it?

00:12:58.030 --> 00:13:01.030
Mayor... Nonchy...?

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:17.880
Oh, I see!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:20.350
So that's what Monchy told you to get!

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:23.150
What a maroon!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.820
Mayor, do you know Monchy-san?

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:29.190
Monchy is Mayor Nonchy's 
younger twin brother.

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:30.060
I kind of thought so!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:32.030
Actually, we're quintuplets.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:33.430
Really?!

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:36.130
But who cares about that nonsense?!

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:40.640
Come on, tonight, we feast! 
Fill yourselves up!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.070
Huh? Mayor...

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:46.140
This house has gas?

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:47.910
What are you, stupid?!

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:50.680
There's no gas in the village!

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:52.920
Then what was that...

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:54.780
An Eco Eco Skunk!

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:58.250
It shares the gas from its farts!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.630
For tap water, I've got 
a Reservoir Sea Cucumber!

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:04.330
It comes in handy.

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:07.200
For when I want a simple 
fire, I use Fire Moss Balls.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.400
If you wash and dry 'em out, you 
can use 'em again and again!

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:12.940
I notice that you also have electricity...

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.910
Night is about to fall.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.810
Maybe I'll turn on the power.

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:18.840
Power?

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:22.410
The ingredient that you guys 
want is over there, too.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.320
Look! That's a Solar Turtle.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.820
It's a turtle equipped with natural 
solar panels on its shell!

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:32.920
It's huge!

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:34.690
All of the private homes in this village

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:37.230
have this power plug.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:41.160
If you connect it to the 
Solar Turtle's tail...

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:44.830
Amazing!

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:47.840
There are small Solar Turtles that 
have as much power as batteries

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:52.070
as well as gigantic turtles that 
can power up the whole town.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.680
Those are some blessed turtles!

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:57.910
Incidentally, when their power runs out,

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.550
the surface of their 
shells peels off lightly,

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.820
and that is exactly...

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.790
...Eco Seaweed!

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.760
What beautiful seaweed!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:15.430
The quality is so high that I can 
smell its fresh flavor from here!

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.500
However, I ain't gonna give 
it to you for free, Toriko.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:22.700
Actually, the weather's been lousy recently,

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:26.740
so the town's Solar Turtles 
can't generate enough power.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:30.010
At a time like this, Solar Turtles

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:33.180
can be charged up manually.

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:34.650
Manually?!

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:39.890
So this is what you meant?!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.860
It's charging up more and more!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.390
What incredible speed!

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:49.960
It seems like the turtle's perked up, too!

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:54.770
Come on, power up, power 
up, power up, power up!

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:57.370
Fully charged!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.590
Hey!

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:17.320
Charge mine, too!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.360
Please!

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.390
What?!

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.600
There are that many Solar Turtles?!

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:28.200
Fine!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:30.300
Bring 'em over!

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:36.440
Power up, power up, power up, 
power up, power up, power up!

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:38.340
Power up!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.340
Alright!

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.770
We got a ton of Eco Seaweed!

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:13.140
You did it, Toriko-san!

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:16.580
With this seaweed, I bet even Monchy 
will be happy enough to make it for us!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.550
I think you're right!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.550
Toriko, give that idiot Monchy a message:

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.050
"You're an idiot!"

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:24.590
Sure. Thank you, Mayor Nonchy!

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.720
Thank you too, Takimaru!

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:28.220
Not at all.

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:31.390
It was fun getting to hang out 
with you again, Toriko-san.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.930
Tell Ai I said goodbye, too.

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:34.600
I will.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:38.630
Alright, let's take this stuff 
and be on our way, Komatsu!

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:39.400
Right!

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.310
Okay!

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:52.610
You gathered so much stuff, you make 
me think you're stupid, Toriko!

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:55.720
It really was tough, Monchy!

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.850
Especially the Durian Bomb...

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:00.960
Idiot! This stinks! It really stinks!

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:04.430
But with all this, it should be enough.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.790
Dopes!

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:10.830
We'll need all these as fillings for 
the place you want me to divine!

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:12.530
1-2! 1-2!

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:14.770
What's that?

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:16.040
Monchy!

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:17.470
We brought it!

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:19.670
Yeah! Thanks!

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:23.410
C-Cutting board?!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:25.750
A cutting board... ring?!

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:28.520
Alright, let's see it!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:29.920
This is gonna be a spectacle!

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:33.150
Okay, guess I'll get started!

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:35.920
Don't tell me... you're 
going to make it here?!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:40.490
Of course, dumbass!

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:45.270
You threw it...

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:48.970
Toriko! The gong!

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:50.000
R-Right!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:54.240
Let the match begin!

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:58.080
What is this?!

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:00.480
There it is! Monchy Press!

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:03.320
You can't make sushi without it!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:06.250
That's Monchy! He never neglects the basics!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.990
Really?!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:12.020
And now I hoist this over my 
head! Monchy Hyper Back Drop!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:16.000
This is sushi preparation?!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.330
Yeah! Awesome preparation!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:23.170
It's also Monchy's way of expressing 
gratitude and love to the ingredients!

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:27.510
Are you an idiot?!

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:28.910
Are you an idiot?!

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:31.910
Certainly, it is getting softer,

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:34.680
and the savoriness appears 
to be concentrating...

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:38.880
You reek, dumbass!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.190
Toriko, the count!

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:44.720
R-Right! 1...

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:45.360
Stinks!

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:45.820
That was fast!

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:50.030
Monchy Arm Lock!

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:52.360
I don't think that does anything...

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:55.600
Seaweed Roll Suplex!

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:57.100
That was close!

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:58.970
You can't let your identity be revealed?!

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:01.170
Okay!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:03.270
What are you, stupid?!

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.280
What are you, stupid?!

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.910
What are you, stupid?!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:09.910
What are you, stupid?!

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:24.590
This is...

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:27.260
...Monchy's Fortune Roll!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:31.330
It's too huge!

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.070
I hope Toriko-san and Komatsu-san

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:41.680
safely make it to their training ingredient.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:42.350
Me too.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.280
But you know,

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.780
the Lost Forest...

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.580
Something incredible awaits them there.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:57.430
Now we can go... to the Lost Forest!

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:11.740
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:19.450
The world is spinning

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.750
A dream flower

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:28.360
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:35.830
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:39.400
Lead me by the hand

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:42.740
And take me with you

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:50.180
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:54.080
Red shoes

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:57.650
I can't take off

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:08.830
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:13.630
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:17.200
Alright, the popular new segment!

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:21.270
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:21.870 --> 00:22:24.840
This'll be a little more 
difficult than last time!

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:28.850
Yun's Hiding Level is 3!

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:33.620
Can you find Yun in the allotted 
time limit of ten seconds?!

00:22:33.950 --> 00:22:35.820
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:38.860
Have you found him yet?

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:40.790
It's hard?

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:43.600
I'll just give a one-gram hint for those 
of you who don't know where he is.

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:46.460
Something looks kind of suspicious 
in the center part of the screen...

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:50.400
Well, did you get it?

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:51.970
Yun is right here!

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:56.910
How was it?

00:22:57.410 --> 00:23:00.110
Next time, Yun will hide in 
another interesting place,

00:23:00.110 --> 00:23:01.880
so everyone look for him, okay?

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:04.520
And now on to our next segment!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:08.310
Th-there it is!

00:23:08.310 --> 00:23:10.860
There it is! The legendary 10-star restaurant, Vanishing Japanese Cuisine!

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:13.460
Wait, no way! Is that really...?!

00:23:13.810 --> 00:23:17.730
Put Your Hands Together and Bow! Gourmet National Treasure, Chin Chin-Chin, Appears!

00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:19.480
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
